{"id": "core-ipndm-v", "name": "iPNDM-v (variable step)", "family": "sampler", "subfamily": "multistep ODE", "plain": "The variable-step version of iPNDM: same history idea, but coefficients depend on the ratios of recent step sizes in \u03c3. Uneven steps are therefore reflected in the weights. One call per step.", "math": "Symbols: x current latent; \u03c3=sigmas[i]; \u03c3'=sigmas[i+1]; D=denoised (x0 prediction after CFG); U=uncond_denoised; d=(x\u2212D)/\u03c3. \nOrder 2: h=\u03c3'\u2212\u03c3, h\u2081=\u03c3\u2212\u03c3_{i\u22121}; c\u2081=(2+h/h\u2081)/2, c\u2082=\u2212(h/h\u2081)/2; x'=x+h(c\u2081d+c\u2082d\u2081).\nOrders 3 and 4 add terms in h, h\u2081, h\u2082, h\u2083 through temp, temp1, temp2 at lines 1253\u20131269; form is x'=x+h\u00b7\u03a3c_jd_j.", "props": {"order": "up to 4 (ramps from 1)", "stages": "1", "stochastic": "deterministic", "multistep": true, "prediction_space": "\u03c3 (Karras ODE slopes)", "final_sigma0": "Explicit: \u03c3'=0 returns D.", "flow_const": "No branch."}, "evidence": [{"where": "ComfyUI/comfy/k_diffusion/sampling.py:1218", "symbol": "sample_ipndm_v"}, {"where": "ComfyUI/comfy/k_diffusion/sampling.py:1239", "symbol": "t_next == 0"}, {"where": "ComfyUI/comfy/k_diffusion/sampling.py:1246", "symbol": "coeff1"}, {"where": "ComfyUI/comfy/k_diffusion/sampling.py:1253", "symbol": "temp"}, {"where": "ComfyUI/comfy/k_diffusion/sampling.py:1265", "symbol": "h_n_1"}, {"where": "ComfyUI/comfy/k_diffusion/sampling.py:1270", "symbol": "coeff4"}], "providers": [{"pack": "core", "author": "Comfy Org and contributors", "licence": "GPL-3.0", "kind": "original", "nodes": ["KSampler", "KSamplerAdvanced", "KSamplerSelect"], "note": "", "verdict": "", "risks": [], "res4lyf": false}], "providers_n": 1, "in_core": true, "live": false, "needs_pack": false, "core_ref": {"sampler_name": "ipndm_v", "node": "KSamplerSelect"}, "family_fit": [], "claims": [{"text": "Comment: from zju-pi diff-sampler solvers.py, Apache 2", "label": "from pack README cla